ShareVaultClaimTest
├── given claimShares
│   ├── given the user has nothing to claim
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── given the user has a settled deposit
│       ├── it should transfer the minted shares to the user
│       ├── it should set the lockup from the settlement time
│       └── given the caller is a third party
│           └── it should still deliver the shares to the user
├── given claimAssets
│   ├── given the user has nothing to claim
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── given the user has a settled redemption
│       └── it should pay USDC out of the reserved assets and shrink the reserve
└── given advanceRedeem
    └── given a redemption that rolled over several epochs
        ├── it should process only the requested number of epochs
        └── it should accumulate claimable assets
